Pollution control property tax exemption-
SF0061
applicability.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Case, Anderson and Dockstader and
Representative(s) Harshman, Larsen, L, Ottman and
Wylie
AN ACT relating to environmental quality; clarifying the applicability of the
property tax exemption for property used to eliminate, control or prevent air,
water or land pollution; requiring rulemaking; and providing for effective
dates.
